**Delete:** exact recursive diagnostic code/count/source-line parsing and report
coupling. Line shifts must remain harmless; a nonrecursive fixture with no
expected circularity must make the gate fail. **Prove:** recursive failure has
at least one circularity diagnostic and no `TS2589`, while the nonrecursive
negative fixture fails the harness when that signal is absent. Estimated
deletion: 30–35 lines.

**Declaration any check — use the pinned native compiler API.** Replace the
emitted-declaration `/\\bany\\b/iu` check with an AST walk. Installed TypeScript
7.0.2's root export contains version metadata, not the old `createSourceFile`
API. Use the verified native entrypoints below; do not import a second compiler,
downgrade, or copy a TypeScript 5 parser example.

```js
import { API } from "typescript/unstable/sync";
import { SyntaxKind } from "typescript/unstable/ast";

// declarationFiles: absolute paths to the emitted local .d.ts files.
const api = new API({ cwd: packageRoot });
let snapshot;
try {
  snapshot = api.updateSnapshot({ openFiles: declarationFiles });
  for (const file of declarationFiles) {
    const source = snapshot.getDefaultProjectForFile(file)?.program.getSourceFile(file);
    if (source === undefined) throw new Error(`Missing declaration AST: ${file}`);
    const visit = (node) => {
      if (node.kind === SyntaxKind.AnyKeyword) {
        declarationIssues.push(`${file}:${node.pos}: erased any type`);
      }
      node.forEachChild(visit);
    };
    visit(source);
  }
} finally {
  snapshot?.dispose();
  api.close();
}
```

Construct `declarationFiles` from the harness's existing emitted-file inventory.
Allocate one API/snapshot for the scan, not one per file. Preserve source-origin
reporting if useful, but use AST node positions for syntax findings. Let the
existing `declarationIssues` failure path reject collected violations. Close
the native API before the outer harness removes temporary directories.

A control containing `type Word = "any"` and a comment mentioning any must pass;
a `type Erased = any` control must fail. Keep the independent recursive-carrier
controls, five-sample budgets, digest, ceilings, and compiler provenance.

Keep internal-owner declaration emit, public-entrypoint declarations, and
packed-consumer execution as separate receipts. Final publication work must
exercise the manifest's actual dist exports; internal source declarations do
not prove those routes. Do not add a build pipeline under this harness cleanup
unless the active task includes that owner.


